---
import { media } from '../../data/media';

const { howItWorks, backgrounds } = media;
const bg = backgrounds.howItWorks;
const stepTexts = [
  'Fibras de Chia e Psyllium prolongam a saciedade e reduzem o apetite.',
  'Ação da Laranja Moro e L-Carnitina.',
  'Ingredientes como Quitosana e Inulina regulam a digestão e reduzem o inchaço.',
  'Componentes que irão dar mais vitalidade no dia a dia.',
];
---

<section
  class="how-it-works section"
  id="como-funciona"
  style={`--bg-desktop: url('${bg.desktop}'); --bg-mobile: url('${bg.mobile || bg.desktop}')`}
>
  <div class="how-it-works__overlay"></div>

  <div class="container how-it-works__container">
    <div class="how-it-works__story letter-block letter-block--white text-center">
      <span class="section-label">A VERDADE SOBRE EMAGRECER</span>
      <h2 class="section-title text-white">
        Por que nada funcionou <span class="text-gradient">até agora?</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="short-lines" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <p>Você já fez dieta restritiva.</p>
        <p>Já cortou o carboidrato. Já passou fome.</p>
        <p>Já comprou chá, cápsula, shake...</p>
        <p>E no final, o peso sempre voltou.</p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        <p>Não é culpa sua.</p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        <p>O problema é que <strong>nenhuma dessas soluções</strong> ataca<br>
        as 4 causas reais do ganho de peso.</p>
        <p>O OzenVitta ataca todas elas. <strong>Ao mesmo tempo.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works__grid">
      {howItWorks.steps.map((step, i) => (
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <img src={step.image} alt="" class="benefit-card__icon" width="80" />
          <h3 set:html={step.title} />
          <p>{stepTexts[i]}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <a href="#oferta" class="btn btn--primary">Quero resolver isso agora</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <img src={howItWorks.floating[0]} alt="" class="floating-decoration floating--left animate-float" width="60" />
  <img src={howItWorks.floating[1]} alt="" class="floating-decoration floating--right animate-float" style="animation-delay: 0.5s" width="80" />
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    background-image: var(--bg-desktop);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: white;
  }

  .how-it-works__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(36, 110, 178, 0.92) 0%, rgba(36, 53, 111, 0.95) 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .how-it-works__container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .how-it-works {
      background-image: var(--bg-mobile);
    }
  }

  .how-it-works__story { margin-bottom: 24px; }

  .how-it-works__story p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
  }

  .how-it-works__story strong {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .how-it-works__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .benefit-card__icon { margin: 0 auto 20px; }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .floating-decoration { position: absolute; opacity: 0.6; }
  .floating--left { left: 5%; top: 50%; }
  .floating--right { right: 5%; bottom: 20%; }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .how-it-works__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .how-it-works__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .floating-decoration { display: none; }
  }
</style>
